v1.2 (client: v1.7)
- Server is automatically indexed to OnlineClicker search system.
- Added more server attributes (`Server.password`, `Server.guests`, `Server.api_port`, `Server.ws_url`, `Server.private`, `Server.web`).
- Added more configuration variables (`[Server] SERVER_PASSWORD`, `[Server] GUESTS`, `[Server] WS_URL`, `[Server] PRIVATE`, `[Server] WEB`).
- Added an API server for sending server info to the OnlineClicker search system (and maybe more in the future).
- Added executable scripts `update_server_git.bat` and `update_server_git.sh`.
- Added `ClientErrorMessage.INVALID_USERNAME` attribute.
- Added more event functions: `on_ws_server_ready()`, `on_api_server_ready()`, `on_client_auth()`.
- Added method `Player.kick()`.
- Added more badges to the `Badge` class.
- Changed event function `on_player_chat`: added `was_sent` parameter.
- Changed event function `on_client_error`: added `json_req` parameter.
- Changed default port from 24588 to 8765.

Misc:
- Edited MOTD banner that shows up when you start the server.
